<title>FRANCE: Eramet first quarter sales fell.</title>
<headline>Eramet first quarter sales fell.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated first quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     985     vs   1,084</p>
<p>    of which nickel			    677     vs     700</p>
<p>		 rapid steel		     308     vs     384</p>
<p>NOTE: Eramet gave the figures in a statement. It also said that first quarter sales and prospects for the second quarter led it to confirm an expected improvement in the group's results for the first half of 1997 over those of the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
